F. Assumption challenge
  Considered vertices: rows, runners, E_safe components, survivor windows,
  interval endpoints, endpoint labels, odd-pair walls, branch choices, and
  proof obligations.  Chosen vertices for the new compression are endpoint
  labels and proof carriers.  This preserves the covering-floor predicate
